oloncelle. Saint-Saëns ne voulait pas qu''il soit publié de son vivant.","hint":"On y entend « Le Cygne ».","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"a55215ce","text":"Camille Saint-Saëns"},{"id":"13353c91","text":"Claude Debussy"},{"id":"f0ab3649","text":"Georges Bizet"},{"id":"7ff66fc6","text":"Hector Berlioz"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"a55215ce"}},{"external_key":"music-411","concept_id":"music.classical.madame_butterfly","concept_label":"Madame Butterfly","type":"mcq","prompt":"Qui a composé l''opéra « Madame Butterfly » ?","explanation":"Créé en 1904, il se déroule à Nagasaki. Puccini a aussi composé « La Bohème » et « Tosca ».","hint":"L''auteur de « Tosca ».","difficulty":55,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"8bc57aa8","text":"Giacomo Puccini"},{"id":"ea335612","text":"Giuseppe Verdi"},{"id":"1b1bfca9","text":"Gioachino Rossini"},{"id":"f0f6fe94","text":"Georges Bizet"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"8bc57aa8"}},{"external_key":"music-412","concept_id":"music.classical.quatuor_a_cordes","concept_label":"Quatuor à cordes","type":"mcq","prompt":"Un quatuor à cordes réunit deux violons, un alto et…","explanation":"C''est la formation reine de la musique de chambre, de Haydn à nos jours.","hint":"Pas de contrebasse.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"0f63ba1f","text":"un violoncelle"},{"id":"1638d637","text":"une contrebasse"},{"id":"1b41aafb","text":"un piano"},{"id":"98756dbf","text":"une harpe"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"0f63ba1f"}},{"external_key":"music-413","concept_id":"music.classical.allegro","concept_label":"Allegro","type":"mcq","prompt":"Sur une partition, que signifie « allegro » ?","explanation":"Les indications de tempo sont en italien : adagio (lent), andante (allant), allegro (vif), presto (très rapide).","hint":"« Gai », en italien.","difficulty":40,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"c8b91646","text":"Vif, rapide"},{"id":"cc2c1a20","text":"Lent"},{"id":"9142c813","text":"Fort"},{"id":"6a892f85","text":"Doux"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"c8b91646"}},{"external_key":"music-414","concept_id":"music.classical.contrebasse","concept_label":"Contrebasse","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel est l''instrument le plus grave de la famille des cordes frottées ?","explanation":"Du plus aigu au plus grave : violon, alto, violoncelle, contrebasse.","hint":"La plus grande.","difficulty":35,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"a0e9873c","text":"La contrebasse"},{"id":"2ca54393","text":"Le violoncelle"},{"id":"9f2cb69a","text":"L''alto"},{"id":"da1c750f","text":"Le violon"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"a0e9873c"}},{"external_key":"music-415","concept_id":"music.classical.periodes_de_la_musique","concept_label":"Périodes de la musique","type":"ordering","prompt":"Classe ces périodes de la musique savante de la plus ancienne à la plus récente.","explanation":"Baroque (Bach, 1600–1750), classique (Mozart, 1750–1820), romantique (Chopin, XIXe), moderne (Stravinsky, XXe).","hint":"Bach, puis Mozart, puis Chopin.","difficulty":50,"status":"published","payload":{"items":[{"id":"51960872","text":"Baroque"},{"id":"f7166c85","text":"Classique"},{"id":"cdc60062","text":"Romantique"},{"id":"02a8da74","text":"Moderne"}]},"answer":{"order":["51960872","f7166c85","cdc60062","02a8da74"]}},{"external_key":"music-416","concept_id":"music.classical.mort_de_mozart","concept_label":"Mort de Mozart","type":"true_false","prompt":"Mozart est mort à 35 ans.","explanation":"Oui : né en 1756, mort en 1791, en laissant son Requiem inachevé.","hint":"Il n''a pas terminé son Requiem.","difficulty":50,"status":"published","payload":{},"answer":{"value":true}},{"external_key":"music-417","concept_id":"music.classical.origine_de_chopin","concept_label":"Origine de Chopin","type":"true_false","prompt":"Frédéric Chopin était d''origine autrichienne.","explanation":"Non : il est né en Pologne, d''un père français. Il a passé la seconde moitié de sa vie à Paris.","hint":"Il est né près