ueur, à Los Angeles. Il remportera neuf titres olympiques en tout.","hint":"Sprint et saut en longueur.","difficulty":55,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"429a5647","text":"Carl Lewis"},{"id":"639165c9","text":"Michael Johnson"},{"id":"1311497c","text":"Maurice Greene"},{"id":"584590be","text":"Edwin Moses"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"429a5647"}},{"external_key":"sport-417","concept_id":"sport.champions.jesse_owens","concept_label":"Jesse Owens","type":"numeric","prompt":"Combien de médailles d''or Jesse Owens a-t-il remportées aux JO de Berlin, en 1936 ?","explanation":"100 m, 200 m, saut en longueur et relais 4 × 100 m, sous les yeux d''Hitler.","hint":"Autant que Carl Lewis en 1984.","difficulty":50,"status":"published","payload":{"decimals":0,"allow_negative":false},"answer":{"value":4,"tolerance":0}},{"external_key":"sport-418","concept_id":"sport.champions.jean_claude_killy","concept_label":"Jean-Claude Killy","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel skieur français remporte les trois épreuves de ski alpin aux JO de Grenoble, en 1968 ?","explanation":"Descente, slalom géant et slalom : le triplé à domicile.","hint":"Il a ensuite coorganisé les JO d''Albertville.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"bb71acda","text":"Jean-Claude Killy"},{"id":"e1a3f5c0","text":"Guy Périllat"},{"id":"92a93b0b","text":"Luc Alphand"},{"id":"4b602e4b","text":"Alexis Pinturault"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"bb71acda"}},{"external_key":"sport-419","concept_id":"sport.champions.ballons_d_or_de_messi","concept_label":"Ballons d''or de Messi","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel footballeur a remporté le Ballon d''or à huit reprises ?","explanation":"Record absolu, de 2009 à 2023. Cristiano Ronaldo en a cinq, Platini trois.","hint":"Un Argentin.","difficulty":35,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"9c86a12f","text":"Lionel Messi"},{"id":"a90fc843","text":"Cristiano Ronaldo"},{"id":"abdd6b12","text":"Michel Platini"},{"id":"2cb38da4","text":"Johan Cruyff"}