":"Du bas du dos au pied.","difficulty":72,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"660c717b","text":"Le nerf sciatique"},{"id":"fe161f0d","text":"Le nerf optique"},{"id":"ea0c26f1","text":"Le nerf vague"},{"id":"ff3f9f0c","text":"Le nerf radial"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"660c717b"}},{"external_key":"hdb-075","concept_id":"science.human_body.lobe_occipital","concept_label":"Lobe occipital","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quelle partie du cerveau traite principalement la vision ?","explanation":"Paradoxalement, il se trouve à l''arrière de la tête, loin des yeux.","hint":"À l''arrière du crâne.","difficulty":75,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"510cce06","text":"Le lobe occipital"},{"id":"e980239f","text":"Le lobe frontal"},{"id":"7c64f3b6","text":"Le lobe temporal"},{"id":"d837da53","text":"Le cervelet"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"510cce06"}},{"external_key":"hdb-076","concept_id":"science.human_body.globules_rouges_sans_noyau","concept_label":"Globules rouges sans noyau","type":"true_false","prompt":"Chez l''humain, les globules rouges adultes n''ont pas de noyau.","explanation":"Ils le perdent en mûrissant, ce qui laisse plus de place à l''hémoglobine.","hint":"Plus de place pour l''hémoglobine.","difficulty":72,"status":"published","payload":{},"answer":{"value":true}},{"external_key":"hdb-077","concept_id":"science.space.planete_la_plus_dense","concept_label":"Planète la plus dense","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quelle est la planète la plus dense du Système solaire ?","explanation":"Environ 5,5 g/cm³, grâce à son gros noyau de fer. Saturne, à l''inverse, flotterait sur l''eau.","hint":"Tu marches dessus.","difficulty":78,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"e944d991","text":"La Terre"},{"id":"a08ef483","text":"Jupiter"},{"id":"d29b2f94","text":"Mercure"},{"id":"0c8f47e3","text":"Saturne"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"e944d991"}},{"external_key":"hdb-078","concept_id":"science.space.new_horizons","concept_label":"New Horizons","type":"mcq","promp