:"Comment appelle-t-on un animal qui mange à la fois des végétaux et de la viande ?","explanation":"L''ours, le cochon et l''humain sont omnivores.","difficulty":15,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"8aeed224","text":"Omnivore"},{"id":"8bce4363","text":"Herbivore"},{"id":"1b3029a7","text":"Carnivore"},{"id":"a97397f1","text":"Insectivore"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"8aeed224"}},{"external_key":"sci-330","concept_id":"science.biology.metamorphosis","concept_label":"Métamorphose","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel animal passe par le stade de têtard ?","explanation":"Le têtard vit dans l''eau et respire par des branchies avant de devenir grenouille.","difficulty":25,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"e653acd1","text":"La grenouille"},{"id":"b825d02b","text":"Le lézard"},{"id":"ce852857","text":"La tortue"},{"id":"c898eb96","text":"Le papillon"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"e653acd1"}},{"external_key":"sci-331","concept_id":"science.biology.caterpillar","concept_label":"Chenille","type":"mcq","prompt":"Que devient une chenille après sa métamorphose ?","explanation":"Dans sa chrysalide, son corps se réorganise complètement.","difficulty":20,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"89cfd9c7","text":"Un papillon"},{"id":"85dae289","text":"Une abeille"},{"id":"d0bf2a0e","text":"Une libellule"},{"id":"2497c644","text":"Un scarabée"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"89cfd9c7"}},{"external_key":"sci-332","concept_id":"science.biology.plants_breathe","concept_label":"Les plantes respirent","type":"true_false","prompt":"Les plantes respirent aussi : elles consomment du dioxygène.","explanation":"Oui, jour et nuit. Mais le jour, la photosynthèse produit bien plus de dioxygène qu''elles n''en consomment.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{},"answer":{"value":true}},{"external_key":"sci-333","concept_id":"science.biology.largest_cell","concept_label":"Plus grosse cellule","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quelle est la plus grosse cellule connue ?","explanatio